{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_hpsts_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_hpsts_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Forging",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_hpsts_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0d6a692821354dd8e9116525ae2a1a76086395699eddad20801cc87c8b7da190",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Vulcan!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*sniff* *sniff*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I smell honey biscuits!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, I just baked some."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wow!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "One for Vulcan, one for me! One for Matterhorn, one for me! One for Lava, one for me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here's another batch of weapons that need repairs, Vulcan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Go play by yourself for a while, Kay. I have some work to get to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We've taken care of the ones that just need honing or oiling, but there are a few that are above our pay grade."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, I'll take a look at them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's been disassembled. Everything's here: Originium circuit, crossbow frame, and other miscellaneous parts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Regular maintenance and testing are complete; the hard part's with a modification."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The user is a sniper, but he wants to add a built-in shield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Like the round shield I designed? It only protects the user, but it's portable and can be carried on the belt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The integrated Originium circuit can boost the user's Arts, or even be used as a weapon itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But adding it to a crossbow adds dead weight while compromising integrity. That's why I was thinking about rejecting the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry, leave it to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The recently developed elastic parts, as well as the ultra-thin ones developed by Blemishine, may come in useful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We'll leave it to you then."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's a lot to do today..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We have a bunch of weapons coming in for repair and maintenance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like they went through the grinder out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look at this crack. The user would've been severely injured without the shield there. See how many arrowheads got caught in it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here's Operator Matterhorn's shield too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Talk about a deep crack... was he trying to dig a tunnel with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Seems like it'll need to be replaced sooner rather than later."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll disassemble it. Check the integrity of the individual parts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is something the matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, n-no, it's just that this is my first chance to work with you, so I'm a bit nervous..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The veterans of the Engineering Department talk about you a lot. I'll do my best!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, good luck."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll find some steel."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hibiscus's staff, Fang's lance, Beagle's shield, Kroos's crossbow..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Their weapons have a tendency to take a beating."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "These are what they used when they first came to Rhodes Island. These are the ones that I've modified. Can you tell the difference?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Rhodes Island operators have to work in a variety of environments, which demands a high degree of versatility from their equipment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Understood!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's also important to take into account each operator's personality and individual needs. The craftsman's intentions must never supplant the user's needs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Like the accessories that Kroos hangs here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Many operators are very attached to their weapons, and we must be extremely attentive to this in our work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The better we know the user, the better we can fulfill their requests."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, this batch of weapons is done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "May they serve their operators well."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Excuse me, Vulcan, are you there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, come in. The door's unlocked."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hello. I would like to commission a new shield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is the one that I've been using. It's gone through a lot of repairs, and it's getting less and less effective in combat. It's time I replaced it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This one? I've worked on it many times."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, I brought it with me from Kjerag."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It was made with steel that could withstand the extremely low temperatures there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Away from Kjerag, however, it no longer performs at the same level."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, you mentioned that before, but I didn't want to replace it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "With the crack from this latest operation, though, I can see that it's reached its limit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We ran into a pack of enraged needleflies, and their poisons have seeped into the crack."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's going to be difficult to clean out the poison and needlefly pieces in order to repair it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even a layman like me can see how complicated it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So... I guess this is the end of the road for this shield; there's no way to get it back to peak form."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let me see."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Needlefly poisons, and pieces from their mouthparts... definitely a headache."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The size of the crack has also warped the structure in the back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The internal cracks are visible to the naked eye... what on earth have you guys been doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And this is after you were able to evade some blows, it looks like... Otherwise, the shield would have already shattered, by the looks of the bite marks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So what do you plan to do with it once you get a new one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Retired equipment is typically sent to storage, either to be used in training or dismantled into parts that can be reused."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Those with special significance are stored separately, or returned to their owners."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This shield was forged by the smiths of House Silverash, passed down to me from my grandfather to my father, both bodyguards to the family."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's a symbol of our vow to give our lives in battle, a vow I took when I received it from my father."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's also a symbol of my duty to protect Lady Ensia, as commanded by my lord."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's why I really appreciate the efforts you've put towards repairing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I fear there's been too much damage this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Perhaps it would be better to clean it up and keep it for remembrance, while we craft a new shield for battle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Making a new one is easy. We have the materials, the knowhow, and I have experience fixing your shield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I want to ask you a question."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If it could be fixed, and not just as good as new, but even better, would you rather have it as a keepsake, or continue to use it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stop worrying about the how."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You came here and told me the story behind it, what it means to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can tell you care a lot about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Caring won't fix a broken shield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You haven't even asked if I could fix it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...That's impossible."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I never said that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Think it over. About what to give up on, and what to keep. Then you make your decision."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's what a lot of operators do when they come to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's talk, Matterhorn."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I spoke to a girl by the name of Rockrock. Do you know her? She's from Victoria, and she's only been here at HQ a few times, but she left a deep impression on me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No... Why do you bring her up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's an interesting girl. A little like myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She was born in an old industrial district, and she feels strongly about everything there. She made everything on her herself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She liked my machines, but she insists on only using things she's made with her own hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Like how you light the furnace and beat iron into ingots every day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is there any point to it? Not really."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The machines here can create ingots faster than I can. Rockrock understands that what she makes isn't necessarily better than what's available on the market."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But you both insist on doing it anyway..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, because there's meaning behind it. It's part of my roots as a blacksmith."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Rockrock insists on using what she made herself because, even though she doesn't reject the new, she feels that her roots are still in that old industrial district."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As for you, no matter how comfortable you are at Rhodes Island, part of you will always be on the snow-covered mountains of Kjerag. You'll always remember the teachings of your father and grandfather."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm asking you, not as a blacksmith but as a friend, to let me continue repairing the shield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Leave it to me. I'm sure you will be happy with the result."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Vulcan wasn't at the meeting just now, was she? I was working with her a few days ago, but I haven't seen her in the workshop lately."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's looking for a new type of metal to repair Matterhorn's shield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "His shield?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But wasn't it heavily corroded by poison? I couldn't get that stuff off, no matter how hard I tried."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I thought he'd give up on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, but I had a chat with him, and apparently Vulcan told him she could fix it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Seriously?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're new here, so you probably don't know that it used to be just her repairing everyone's weapons before we got more people in the department."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I even heard that she once forged a legendary weapon, which shook heaven and earth when it left the forge!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It made all of Rhodes Island tremble... possibly a little exaggerated, of course, but she definitely lives up to her code name."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, how I want to bear witness to her work..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is she in the workshop? Can I go watch after I finish my work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nope, she went out to hunt for ore after assigning my duties."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's probably digging around in a cave somewhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_caveentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Villager's Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Careful, girl! A big monster lives in that hole. No one dares get close to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Villager's Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Trust me, plenty of folks have come looking for gold or treasure, but very few have returned."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Villager's Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And with a leg like that! You're walking into a death trap."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just keep your distance, sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Villager's Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*sigh* Young folks these days."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Phew..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here. Not far from the projected position."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Environment and scale are within projections."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The terrain may present some difficulties, but the bait and sedative are ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Kjerag steel is forged in a way that makes it stronger in a cold environment. It will take the perfect replacement to repair it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A few years ago, I found a small piece of crystal on an Originium slug. It had absorbed the slug's secretions, making it extremely strong."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The well is about 300m deep. My gear checks out."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I think I got something!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good, they're all out cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry, this won't hurt... all I need is some of these crystals..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh no, there's another nest in back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Completed deposit and strength testing under different temperatures."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Layering looks like it can work well. Layering steel with materials that have high tensile strength helps keep the weapon together during impact."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I need to think about quenching time and temperature, however."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I tried a partial quenching a couple of days ago, and the metal shattered."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "More precise temperature control is required."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll need to remove this shelf to make room in the workshop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Columbia really does make fine machines."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Let's start."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Highlight composition ratios, oxygen levels..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Setting temperature and time based on this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Adjust the angle... increase temperature... initialize..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, that's close to maximum!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There we go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*cough* A new forging method—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Test successful."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_trainingcom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Vulcan? What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good morning, Instructor Dobermann."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can I use the training facilities to test this shield?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Should I grab a trainee or two to help you out? Practicing with a veteran will do them some good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even better, thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reserve Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ready, Instructor!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_trainingcom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's not enough. Don't hold anything back. Throw everything you have at the shield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry about injuring me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reserve Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Instructor...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do it. Vulcan is a lot stronger than you are, and she's forged this shield using a new method."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reserve Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, ma'am!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reserve Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*pant*... *pant*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can I ask you to give it a try yourself, Instructor Dobermann?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ready!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nice shield!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "C-Closure! Excuse me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Operator B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did... did Vulcan really make a weapon that made Rhodes Island tremble?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who told you that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two weeks later..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whew—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And right on schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's time for one more round of tests before the deadline."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Excuse me, Vulcan, are you there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Come in, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've fixed your shield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sorry, Vulcan, I didn't think you would actually pull it off..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Try it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It... it really is my shield!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You really made it good as new!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes. I used a new forging method, and found a mineral with the right tensile strength to supplement the steel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not quite as cold-resistant as the original, but the layered structure allows it to maintain adequate strength even in extreme conditions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's every bit as strong as it was. I didn't do anything with the shape, but I've added some Originium circuits in the back. They're automatically triggered and don't require the user to be skilled with Arts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't test it here, though; do it with the equipment at the training grounds."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I never thought... I didn't think it was possible, but you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In just two weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Two weeks was plenty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I didn't know... When you went on a field trip a few days ago, I thought it was going to get delayed..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Matterhorn",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you so much, Vulcan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is my job, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I do this to help operators fix their weapons, meet their needs, and allow the equipment to perform at its best."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Each person's armament means something different to its owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As a craftsman, I strive to deliver the best results."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vulcan",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's all."
    },
